sequenceDiagram
    participant T1 as Time 1
    participant T2 as Time 2
    participant T3 as Time 3
    participant T4 as Time 4

    Note over T1: Start with base RDB snapshot
    Note over T2: Apply AOF up to failure point
    Note over T3: Trim AOF if needed
    Note over T4: Restore with fixed AOF

    T1->>T2: Load RDB snapshot
    T2->>T3: Apply AOF commands
    T3->>T4: Resume normal operation